tmp
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.*.swp
.claude/**/*.lock

# Ephemeral SQLite state from the demo-scratchpad probe server. Findings
# live in analyses/oai-web-run-url-dedup/outputs/; the DB regenerates on
# each probe run.
demo-scratchpad/probes.db
demo-scratchpad/probes.db-shm
demo-scratchpad/probes.db-wal

# Full-paste-body dumps regenerated by scrape/pastebin_k4be.py. The
# filtered agent-logs/pastebin-k4be/ export is the durable record; the raw
# dump is kept out of the tree so greps for swarm terms only hit the
# filtered corpus. Regenerate with: python3 scrape/pastebin_k4be.py
scrape/outputs/pastebin-k4be/bodies.jsonl
scrape/outputs/pastebin.tarcseh.me/bodies.jsonl
scrape/outputs/paste.centos.org/bodies.jsonl
scrape/outputs/pastebin.freepbx.org/bodies.jsonl
scrape/outputs/paste.lightcast.com/bodies.jsonl

# swarm.termina.digital mirror: the biggest tables/bundles regenerate
# from /pub/manifest.json + /pub/datasets/datasets.json. Keep the
# manifest in-tree so someone cloning can verify what they re-download.
scrape/outputs/swarm.termina.digital/pub/record.jsonl
scrape/outputs/swarm.termina.digital/pub/datasets/xz-ubuntu-cn-*.tar.gz

# popcat-wayback raw HTML dumps regenerate from
# scrape/popcat_wayback.py via Wayback CDX+id_. Parsed JSONL and
# manifest.json are kept so the export step in analyses/ is reproducible
# without a network round-trip.
scrape/outputs/popcat-wayback/listing/
scrape/outputs/popcat-wayback/info_pages/
